    "steam_appid": 3448430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/f44c0760eeeb5882b21eca812d82eb5c.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special letter, endowed with a soul, embarks on a journey. Change your form to move forward: fly, swim, overcome obstacles, and be ready for unexpected encounters!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/c1e19c8f886c575612362471be730ac3.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/60921e9b38097743d4a213dbe40fee16.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/60921e9b38097743d4a213dbe40fee16.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/60921e9b38097743d4a213dbe40fee16.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar things appear completely different when viewed from another perspective, such as from the deck of a tiny paper boat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/d9f0a11497f0bc5cd299e1c3b09cf769.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/36cfd3376be8edb12a7764a681811e0d.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/36cfd3376be8edb12a7764a681811e0d.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/36cfd3376be8edb12a7764a681811e0d.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a unique adventure with multiple paths to discover. Choose your route, meet strange and charming characters, solve puzzles, uncover hidden locations, and stumble upon secrets in the most unexpected places.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/40445305858ebd331d86e4c35286a9d6.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7f7690640343288b88663508e0465cee.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7f7690640343288b88663508e0465cee.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7f7690640343288b88663508e0465cee.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every origami form brings a new ability and changes the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, meditative atmosphere to relax and unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through different eras and fantastical worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/f44c0760eeeb5882b21eca812d82eb5c.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7851fe5be7bb5c18b439bd1c44c7745c.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special letter, endowed with a soul, embarks on a journey. Change your form to move forward: fly, swim, overcome obstacles, and be ready for unexpected encounters!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/c1e19c8f886c575612362471be730ac3.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/60921e9b38097743d4a213dbe40fee16.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/60921e9b38097743d4a213dbe40fee16.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/60921e9b38097743d4a213dbe40fee16.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar things appear completely different when viewed from another perspective, such as from the deck of a tiny paper boat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/d9f0a11497f0bc5cd299e1c3b09cf769.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/36cfd3376be8edb12a7764a681811e0d.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/36cfd3376be8edb12a7764a681811e0d.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/36cfd3376be8edb12a7764a681811e0d.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a unique adventure with multiple paths to discover. Choose your route, meet strange and charming characters, solve puzzles, uncover hidden locations, and stumble upon secrets in the most unexpected places.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/40445305858ebd331d86e4c35286a9d6.webp?t=1755639576\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7f7690640343288b88663508e0465cee.poster.avif?t=1755639576\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7f7690640343288b88663508e0465cee.webm?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/7f7690640343288b88663508e0465cee.mp4?t=1755639576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every origami form brings a new ability and changes the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, meditative atmosphere to relax and unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through different eras and fantastical worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
